{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"duration_ms":118264,"duration_api_ms":116454,"num_turns":18,"result":"","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"52fda848-8505-46d0-a427-1cc4f3bf7069","total_cost_usd":0.83670675,"usage":{"input_tokens":1076,"cache_creation_input_tokens":65491,"cache_read_input_tokens":619866,"output_tokens":4483,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":65491,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":1076,"outputTokens":4483,"cacheReadInputTokens":619866,"cacheCreationInputTokens":65491,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.83670675,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"structured_output":{"outcome":"approved","evidence":["Full tank_core package test suite passes with zero failures across all unit and integration test binaries. cargo clippy -p tank_core -- -D warnings clean. cargo fmt --all --check clean.","All 23 substrate unit tests pass, covering every acceptance criterion: rooted_plants_increase_o2_penetration, root_oxygenation_proportional_to_biomass_with_diminishing_returns, floating_plant_biomass_does_not_increase_penetration, zero_root_biomass_yields_zero_oxygenation_bonus, root_oxygenation_uses_named_parameter, root_oxygenation_dynamic_tracks_biomass_growth_and_decline, root_oxygenation_requires_rootable_substrate_habitats, zero_rol_rate_removes_rooted_oxygenation_effects.","All 5 root_zone_oxygenation integration tests pass: planted_vs_unplanted_diverge_in_penetration_depth (500h), planted_substrate_denitrification_interaction (500h), root_oxygenation_reduces_hourly_denitrification_when_it_shrinks_suboxic_volume, planted_substrate_nitrification_surface_area (500h with nitrifier/nitrate divergence), tracing_exposes_root_oxygenation.","All 6 habitat geometry probe tests pass (5 probes + summary). cargo clippy -p tank_harness -- -D warnings clean.","ROL formula verified correct (substrate.rs:99-111): bonus = total_depth × (1 - exp(-(active_root_biomass_g × rol_rate_cm_per_g) / total_depth)). Saturating exponential — linear at low biomass, asymptotic to substrate depth. Satisfies the diminishing-returns acceptance criterion.","Only PlantGuild::RootFeedingRosette contributes to active root biomass (substrate.rs:146 guild filter). Floating/epiphytic/fast-stem guilds excluded.","rol_rate_cm_per_g is a named parameter in ProcessParams (process.rs:176-189) with serde default 0.15 cm/g, invariant-checked non-negative, and present in default.toml. Not hardcoded.","Tracing output verified: step_substrate_zones emits structured tracing::debug! at substrate.rs:59-69 with base_penetration_cm, root_oxygenation_bonus_cm, active_root_biomass_g, effective_penetration_cm as separate named fields.","step_substrate_zones returns SubstrateOxygenationBreakdown and engine.rs reuses the returned value for budget metrics — no redundant recomputation at the engine level.","Biofilter probe (fr-4-08002dd1 fix confirmed): Now uses explicit media constants (500 vs 4000 cm²), asserts nitrifier_large > nitrifier_small (line 448), validates reduced N exposure ordering (line 439), and checks clearance timing. No longer uses a shared floor check. Output shows capacity 0.747->1.278g, reduced-N exposure 1834.70->1696.08.","Redox probe (fr-4-e772c7bf fix confirmed): Denitrifier activity seeded at 0.1 (line 917) via shared configure_redox_baseline, not 1.0. Asserts planted_final_activity > planted_initial_activity + 0.25 (line 1136) to exercise maturation ramp. Asserts inert_final_activity < inert_initial_activity (line 1145) to exercise decay. Output shows activity 0.10->0.40 (planted) and 0.10->0.05 (inert).","Planted substrate confound (fr-4-d4d1e581 fix confirmed): DECOMPOSER_BIOMASS_G = 10.0 is a shared constant applied identically to both arms via configure_redox_baseline (line 920). Planted arm has live RootFeedingRosette plants at 6.0g biomass (lines 988-994). Inert arm depth reduced to 1.0cm (line 1009) for full oxygenation. Plant biomass zeroed only in inert arm (lines 1022-1024). Test validates presence of live rooted plants and PlantSurfaces habitat area (line 1109)."],"findings_or_gaps":["Minor: from_parts (engine.rs:132) discards the SubstrateOxygenationBreakdown returned by step_substrate_zones during initialization. Harmless since init-time tracing isn't needed, but a minor API inconsistency. Non-blocking.","Minor: root_oxygenation_active_biomass_g() internally calls compute_habitat_registry() on each invocation, and substrate_oxygenation_breakdown() also calls this function, creating a redundant registry computation within the substrate module. Non-blocking — the computation is cheap and the engine-level double-computation was already fixed."],"follow_up_or_amendments":["No blocking amendments required. All acceptance criteria are satisfied with passing tests, clean clippy, and clean formatting across both tank_core and tank_harness packages. The three final-review amendments (biofilter scaling, redox maturation, planted substrate confound) have all been properly addressed in this round."]},"fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"7a8708dc-564e-4299-afd1-b700cd8ea5b2"}
